To maintain compliance with the law, every consumer reporting agency must establish reasonable procedures to prevent violations of section 1681c and restrict the provision of consumer reports to the purposes outlined in section 1681b, as stated in 15 U.S. Code 1681e. Unfortunately, XXXX and Experian have failed to uphold these reasonable procedures. 

