7157655,2023-06-24,Credit card or prepaid card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Trouble using your card,Can't use card to make purchases,"XX/XX/XXXX To Whom It May Concern : Monday, XX/XX/XXXX : My Wells Fargo ( WF ) credit card was denied at XXXX in XXXX XXXX. 

